# Secrets and data

- Never commit API keys, service-role keys, JWTs, passwords, or `.env` contents.
- Do not put placeholder secrets that look real. Use env var names only.
- Treat CSV customer names as personal data in logs and docs examples.
- When a `.gitignore` is added, exclude `.env*`, `__pycache__/`, and build artifacts.
